instanceMethods.comment:
Returns the triangulation of this face according to the mesh purpose.
@param thePurpose a mesh purpose to find appropriate triangulation (NONE by default).
@returns an active triangulation in case of NONE purpose, the first triangulation appropriate for the input purpose, just the first triangulation if none matching other criteria and input purpose is AnyFallback or null handle if there is no any suitable triangulation.

Sets input triangulation for this face.
@param theTriangulation triangulation to be set
@param theToReset flag to reset triangulations list to new list with only one input triangulation. If theTriangulation is NULL internal list of triangulations will be cleared and active triangulation will be nullified. If theToReset is TRUE internal list of triangulations will be reset to new list with only one input triangulation that will be active. Else if input triangulation is contained in internal triangulations list it will be made active, else the active triangulation will be replaced to input one.

staticMethods.comment:
Returns the triangulation of the face according to the mesh purpose.
@param theFace the input face to find triangulation.
@param theLocation the face location. Mutated in place; read the updated value from this argument after the call.
@param theMeshPurpose a mesh purpose to find appropriate triangulation (NONE by default).
@returns an active triangulation in case of NONE purpose, the first triangulation appropriate for the input purpose, just the first triangulation if none matching other criteria and input purpose is AnyFallback or null handle if there is no any suitable triangulation.

